[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0180","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0180.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0608","title":"PDG Shopping Cart shopper.cgi 配置错误导致敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"PDG 购物车的 CGI 程序 shopper.cgi 由于配置不当，在特定请求下会把购物车系统中存储的私人订单信息、用户账户资料等机密数据返回给未授权访问者。该漏洞可通过网络远程触发，攻击无需认证，仅需向存在缺陷的 shopper.cgi 发送构造请求即可读取敏感内容，影响部署了错误配置 PDG Shopping Cart 的 Web 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0608"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-04-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"修正 shopper.cgi 的配置文件，禁用调试或信息展示选项，限制该 CGI 仅对授权会话返回数据，并在 Web 服务器层面（如 .htaccess 或访问控制列表）对 shopper.cgi 增加访问控制与输入校验，避免未授权用户读取敏感订单与账户信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92462991805485&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3857"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0180.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0180.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1181","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1181.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1559","title":"Xylan OmniSwitch 登录提示符拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Xylan OmniSwitch 3.2.6 之前版本存在登录认证绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在登录提示符处发送 CTRL-D 控制字符绕过身份验证，由于该设备仅支持单会话同时登录，此操作将导致其他合法用户被锁定无法访问交换机管理界面，造成拒绝服务。攻击无需认证即可远程触发，影响设备可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1559"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-03-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:42Z","remediation":"立即将 Xylan OmniSwitch 升级至 3.2.6 或更高版本，该版本修复了 CTRL-D 字符绕过登录提示的缺陷。如无法升级，可在网络层面配置 ACL，限制仅信任 IP 地址可访问交换机的管理端口（如 telnet/SSH 端口），防止未授权远程连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92299263017061&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2064","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e37edb84f090321c2ab4b4aefc57f84a75b1b940/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1559.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1559","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1559.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1559.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j2j2-54qm-hh8q/GHSA-j2j2-54qm-hh8q.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87962/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1559.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/c51ad86fdcd385e00e18d9d5ea4cfa55540e5dc1/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1181.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0106","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0434","title":"XFree86 xfs 符号链接攻击本地权限提升漏洞","description":"XFree86 的 xfs（X 字体服务器）命令存在符号链接攻击漏洞，本地攻击者可通过在临时目录中创建恶意符号链接，诱使 xfs 以提升的权限向受限目录写入文件，从而导致权限提升或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 XFree86 的 NetBSD 及其他类 Unix 系统，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0434"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-03-30T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:23Z","remediation":"升级 XFree86 至 3.3.5 及以上版本以修复 xfs 符号链接漏洞，或应用 NetBSD 厂商发布的对应安全补丁。临时缓解措施：限制不可信用户的本地登录权限，确保 xfs 临时目录（如 /tmp/.X11-unix）具有正确权限（1777）且不可被符号链接攻击利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/359","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e6f80460dd56d97b6079eb72c9467b9a961ce1b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0434.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0434","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0434.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a75ebb477762f54f32c38d85ec939339ec2712e5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0434.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2g65-vp99-qwv8/GHSA-2g65-vp99-qwv8.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/359/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0434.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f067e6f3-94b3-4865-b51d-3ed58fe18b33.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1906","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1906.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1397","title":"Microsoft Index Server 物理路径信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 中的 Index Server 2.0 组件在注册表 AllowedPaths 键的 ContentIndex\\Catalogs 子键中存储了被索引目录的物理路径信息。由于该注册表项的权限设置不当，本地及远程攻击者可通过访问注册表获取正在被索引的目录物理路径，从而泄露系统敏感信息。该漏洞影响 IIS 4.0 及配套的 Index Server 2.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞收集目标系统信息，为后续攻击提供铺垫。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1397"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-03-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:21Z","remediation":"升级到 Windows 2000 或更高版本操作系统及对应 IIS 版本，Index Server 2.0 仅在 Windows NT 4.0 Option Pack 中提供，后续版本已修复此问题。如无法升级，应使用 regedt32 将注册表 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\System\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\ContentIndex\\Catalogs 键的权限从 Everyone 读取限制为仅 SYSTEM 和 Administrators 可访问，并移除 ContentIndex 子键下 AllowedPaths 中不必要的物理路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92242671024118&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=92223293409756&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7559.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/476","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/36911ad057245f7d02822794db0f459d9b4c9b8f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1397.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1397","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1397.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e5f1cf9bcfe839897275a956236aed334269/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1397.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vvqj-w228-7466/GHSA-vvqj-w228-7466.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1397.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000583.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8c819e08-07e7-43f1-8c2b-fa277db729fe.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idinfor"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1906.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1086","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1086.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1370","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.0 安装向导信息泄露漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 5.0 的安装向导 (ie5setup.exe) 在无人值守安装过程中会禁用屏幕保护程序和任务计划程序服务。若安装过程发生故障，系统将处于登录状态下而无屏保保护，使具有物理接触权限的攻击者可利用该配置缺陷获取系统访问权限。同时任务计划程序被禁用可能导致安全关键程序无法按时执行，降低系统整体安全性。CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1370"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-03-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:17Z","remediation":"该漏洞存在于 Internet Explorer 5.0 安装程序 (ie5setup.exe) 中，微软已在后续版本修复。建议立即升级至 Internet Explorer 6.0 及以上版本，或使用现代浏览器（如 Edge/Chrome/Firefox）替代。如暂时无法升级，请在 ie5setup.exe 完成安装后手动重新启用屏幕保护程序（控制面板→显示→屏幕保护程序）和任务计划程序服务（services.msc→Task Scheduler→启动）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=92220197414799&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/41de94138b7cf6e858138ec4e79e16fbec611fa4/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1370.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1370","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1370.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e5f1cf9bcfe839897275a956236aed334269/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1370.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9ccbfe3349/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-grpf-xfq7-g359/GHSA-grpf-xfq7-g359.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87870/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1370.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000582.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1086.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0085","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0085.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0428","title":"OpenSSL OpenSSL SSL会话重用漏洞","description":"OpenSSL 及 SSLeay 早期版本（0.9.2b 之前）存在会话固定漏洞（CWE-384），远程攻击者无需身份认证即可重用已建立的 SSL 会话，从而绕过访问控制机制获取未授权访问权限。攻击者可通过诱导目标用户使用预先设定的会话标识建立 SSL 连接，随后利用该会话冒充合法用户执行敏感操作。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 OpenSSL 和 SSLeay 的应用程序及服务，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0428"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"1999-03-22T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:22Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenSSL 至 0.9.2b 或更高版本（当前最新稳定版为 3.x 系列）；SSLeay 已停止维护，应全面迁移至 OpenSSL。在应用层启用服务端会话超时机制，对每次 SSL 会话独立生成 session ID 并校验，防止未授权会话复用绕过访问控制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/3936","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/1999/CVE-1999-0428.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0428.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0428","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0428.json","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2020/openssl/gb_openssl_CVE-1999-0428.nasl","https://github.com/secure-software-engineering/achilles-benchmark-depscanners/blob/78b391f47cbe64adf7a2e2182ff94be604eb94dd/detection/CVE-1999-0428__org.jruby_openssl_0.9.4.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0428.md","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/0xxx/cve-1999-0428.yaml","https://github.com/SAP/fosstars-rating-core/blob/7b172f42f218f6cfad42f81bd9c9ef49de35b919/docs/oss/security/openssl/openssl.md","https://github.com/eclipse-ee4j/krazo/blob/a92003e894f263caa501df02fe1812b62ebbb8ee/dependency-check-suppressions.xml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0085.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0154","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0154.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0481","title":"OpenBSD poll 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 2.4 的 poll 系统调用存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制请求触发 poll 函数异常处理，导致系统内核崩溃或服务不可用。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 2.4 版本，CVSS v2 评分 5.0，攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可远程触发，危害等级中等。建议升级到 OpenBSD 2.5 或更高版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0481"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-03-22T00:00:00Z","updated":"1999-03-22T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级至 OpenBSD 2.5 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 OpenBSD 2.4 errata 003 号补丁中修复。如无法升级，可下载并应用 OpenBSD 官方提供的 poll(2) 源码补丁（https://www.openbsd.org/errata24.html#poll），重新编译内核后重启系统。对于已停止维护的旧版本，建议迁移至受支持的 OpenBSD 最新稳定版。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0154.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0155","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0155.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0482","title":"OpenBSD 2.4 内核 TSS 处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 2.4 内核的 TSS（任务状态段）处理逻辑存在缺陷，本地攻击者可通过运行 crashme 程序触发内核崩溃，导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞源于内核在 TSS 切换时未正确处理异常状态，攻击者无需特殊权限即可利用，影响 OpenBSD 2.4 版本。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等，建议升级至更高版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0482"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-03-21T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:29Z","remediation":"立即升级到 OpenBSD 2.5 或更高版本；若无法升级，请从 OpenBSD 官方 errata 页面下载并应用 2.4 内核补丁 019（针对 crashme 程序导致的 TSS 处理崩溃），该补丁以 unified diff 格式提供，按补丁内说明重新编译内核后重启即可。作为临时缓解措施，可限制本地用户登录或禁用 crashme 等压力测试工具的运行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/7557"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0155.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0098","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0098.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0433","title":"XFree86 X11R6 startx 符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"<value>XFree86 X11R6 3.3.3 版本中 startx 命令存在符号链接跟进缺陷。本地攻击者可在执行 startx 命令时，利用竞态条件，通过创建指向受限目录的符号链接，诱导系统将文件写入特定受限位置，从而可能提升权限或引发拒绝服务。该漏洞利用前提是攻击者需拥有本地有效账号并在符号链接创建与文件写入之间执行竞态攻击。攻击者可利用此漏洞修改系统文件、覆盖配置文件或耗尽磁盘空间等。CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中级，属于本地权限提升类漏洞。用户应升级至 XFree86 最新版本或应用官方补丁以避免受此漏洞影响。</arg_value></tool_call>","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0433"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-03-21T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:23Z","remediation":"立即升级 XFree86 3.3.3 到 3.3.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了多个安全问题包括 startx 脚本的 symlink 攻击漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在系统启动前执行以下缓解措施：删除并重建 /tmp/.X11-unix 目录并设置粘滞位权限（rm -rf /tmp/.X11-unix && mkdir -m 1777 /tmp/.X11-unix），确保普通用户无法通过该目录替换系统文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0433","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19257","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e3ffc8aa96e889e4591b3a2ccc4e1f7e6b2ab4fc/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0433.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8d0003712fd6ee4e2d0881313cc643a9a3a69d63/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0433.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0433.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0433","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0433.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-04xx/CVE-1999-0433.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/050f0b0b35f5586b897c9fa1e5cb22907b6f29e8/1999/CVE-1999-0433.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0433.md","https://github.com/justakazh/CVE_Database/blob/06bd07f32c89b43f30d59ff450dfbb661e471cbe/1999/CVE-1999-0433.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/fd9cadff39b120393c2c764effdf6aaef24df325/api/1999/CVE-1999-0433.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0098.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0098.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0078","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0078.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0425","title":"Netscape Communicator talkback 本地进程终止漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 4.5 浏览器的 \"talkback\" 崩溃报告功能存在本地权限滥用漏洞。当一位用户的 Netscape 程序崩溃时，talkback 组件未能正确隔离进程间操作权限，允许同一系统上的本地攻击者利用该机制向任意其他用户的进程发送终止信号，导致非授权进程被终止。攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限且目标用户需运行易受攻击的 Netscape 版本，造成拒绝服务或关键服务中断。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0425"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-03-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:22Z","remediation":"升级至 Netscape 4.6 及以上版本可修复此漏洞。对于无法升级的环境，建议禁用 talkback 功能：删除或重命名 Netscape 安装目录下的 talkback 可执行文件，或通过配置文件禁用 crash reporter 组件。鉴于 Netscape 浏览器已停止维护，强烈建议迁移至 Firefox 或 Chrome 等现代浏览器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0425","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f4ffb7bcd93209aa53a757a7ebdf17fe2a18eb33/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0425.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0425","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0425.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a75ebb477762f54f32c38d85ec939339ec2712e5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0425.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7gf5-w5c8-cpr2/GHSA-7gf5-w5c8-cpr2.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0425.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x83000/82494/info.html","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000580.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1533f373-1dea-4090-b2f5-07632a1ff6e8.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0078.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0076","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0076.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0424","title":"Netscape Communicator 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 4.5 中集成的 talkback 崩溃报告组件存在任意文件写入漏洞。当目标用户的 Netscape 浏览器发生崩溃时，talkback 进程会以该用户权限执行文件写入操作，同一系统上的本地攻击者可利用此机制覆盖受害用户的任意文件，造成数据破坏或信息泄露。攻击依赖本地访问且需用户浏览器崩溃触发，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。建议升级软件或禁用 talkback 组件。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0424"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-03-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:22Z","remediation":"升级 Netscape Communicator 至 4.51 及以上版本即可修复此漏洞；若无法升级，可删除或重命名 talkback 可执行文件（通常位于 Netscape 安装目录下的 `talkback` 文件）以禁用崩溃报告功能。作为临时缓解措施，确保 `/tmp` 目录设置粘滞位（chmod +t /tmp），防止非所有者删除或覆盖文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0424"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0076.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0126","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0126.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0462","title":"Linux Perl suidperl 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux Perl 中的 suidperl 组件在解析 setuid 脚本时未检查文件系统的 nosuid 挂载选项，本地攻击者可将特制 setuid Perl 脚本放置于可挂载文件系统（如 CD-ROM 或软盘）上，通过诱使目标系统挂载并执行该脚本触发漏洞。成功利用后可获取 root 权限执行任意代码，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 SUSE Linux 等多个发行版，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0462"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-03-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:26Z","remediation":"升级 Perl 至 5.004_04 或更高版本，该版本已修复 suidperl 对 nosuid 挂载选项的检查逻辑。作为临时缓解措施，执行 `chmod u-s /usr/bin/suidperl` 移除 suidperl 的 setuid 权限位，并将所有可移动文件系统（如 CD-ROM、软盘）以 `nosuid` 选项挂载，防止攻击者通过可移动介质提权至 root。长期建议迁移至 suidperl 已被彻底移除的 Perl 5.26+ 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/339"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0126.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0074","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0074.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0422","title":"NetBSD mount noexec 标志绕过漏洞","description":"NetBSD 1.3.3 的 mount 命令存在安全绕过漏洞，本地攻击者可通过挂载特定的文件系统绕过 \"noexec\" 标志限制，在标记为禁止执行的文件系统上执行任意程序。该漏洞影响 NetBSD 1.3.3 版本，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。建议升级至 NetBSD 1.4 及以上版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0422"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-03-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:21Z","remediation":"升级 NetBSD 至 1.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复 mount 命令忽略 noexec 标志的问题。如无法立即升级，可在 /etc/fstab 中对敏感分区额外设置 nosuid 标志并限制本地用户登录，降低绕过执行的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0422"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0074.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0072","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0072.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0420","title":"BSD umapfs 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"umapfs（用户映射文件系统）存在权限提升漏洞，本地攻击者可通过恶意构造的 mount_umap 程序修改自身用户标识符（UID），从而绕过系统权限检查获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响使用 umapfs 的 UNIX 系统，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0420"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-03-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:21Z","remediation":"立即移除 mount_umap 程序的 setuid-root 权限（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/mount_umap），如不使用 umapfs 文件系统可直接卸载该组件。联系操作系统厂商确认是否有对应安全补丁，升级到已修复 umapfs 漏洞的版本。在不影响业务的前提下，禁用 umapfs 内核模块支持以防止恶意加载。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0420"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0072.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0073","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0073.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0421","title":"Slackware Linux 安装后重启root账户未授权登录漏洞","description":"Linux Slackware 3.6 系统在安装后首次重启过程中存在身份认证绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可在系统启动阶段利用 root 账号无需密码直接登录，从而获得系统最高权限。该漏洞源于安装程序在初次重启时未正确设置 root 账户密码，攻击条件简单，无需任何身份凭证即可完全控制目标系统。影响范围包括 Slackware 3.6 及可能的相关版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0421"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-03-17T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装完成后首次重启前，务必使用 passwd root 命令为 root 账户设置强密码。升级到 Slackware Linux 3.6 以上版本，新版本在安装流程中强制要求设置 root 密码。如无法升级，可在 /etc/inittab 中配置单用户模式需要密码认证，并检查 /etc/shadow 确保 root 密码字段非空。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/981","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/338"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0073.toml"}]